    seed_jit_typed_optional_holding_user_none_takes_some_arm_2026-11-27, P3, open, "Seed JIT vs interpreter: typed Q? holding a user Q.None takes the Some arm on the JIT and the None arm on the interpreter", src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/interpreter_patterns.rs, 0, NONE, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true
